{"id":"c07","stage":1,"title":"在餐厅点餐","scene":"向店员说明口味和需要。","roles":["店员","你"],"lines":[{"id":"c07-1","ko":"주문하시겠어요?","zh":"您要点餐吗？","note":"服务场景中的礼貌表达。","words":[{"term":"주문하다","zh":"点餐","id":"dc82df55affb977b","audio":"/audio/dc82df55affb977bd3f4.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/fd8271d97aac7391c1fb.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"주문하시겠어요?","meaning":"您要点餐吗？","explanation":"주문하다（点餐）+ -시-（尊敬）+ -겠-（这里委婉询问意愿）+ -어요（礼貌体）。","readings":[{"term":"주문하다","audio":"/audio/dc82df55affb977bd3f4.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주문하시겠어요","audio":"/audio/49b3951617ea58b70885.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c07-2","ko":"비빔밥 하나 주세요.","zh":"请给我一份拌饭。","note":"食物份数在口语中常直接用 하나。","words":[{"term":"비빔밥","zh":"拌饭","id":"574c26d169130a08","audio":"/audio/574c26d169130a0860b8.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/b7090c9267efdbd41ba2.mp3","speakerIndex":1,"parts":[{"text":"비빔밥","meaning":"拌饭","explanation":"비빔밥是餐品名。","readings":[{"term":"비빔밥","audio":"/audio/574c26d169130a0860b8.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"비빔밥","audio":"/audio/574c26d169130a0860b8.mp3"}},{"text":"하나","meaning":"一份","explanation":"固有数词하나（一）；这里省略量词。","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"请给我","explanation":"주다（给）+ -세요（礼貌请求）。","readings":[{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}]},{"id":"c07-3","ko":"매운 음식 잘 드세요?","zh":"您能吃辣吗？","note":"잘 드세요 在这里询问是否能接受辣味。","words":[{"term":"맵다","zh":"辣","id":"13d9c3d2d64fee08","audio":"/audio/13d9c3d2d64fee08dc08.mp3"},{"term":"음식","zh":"食物","id":"2e144916046c2a6f","audio":"/audio/2e144916046c2a6fc7df.mp3"},{"term":"먹다","zh":"吃","id":"9639f892bdddb53f","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"audio":"/audio/d22be39dd3e458ae5d66.mp3","speakerIndex":0,"parts":[{"text":"매운","meaning":"辣的","explanation":"맵다（辣）→ 매운，ㅂ不规则的定语形式。","readings":[{"term":"맵다","audio":"/audio/13d9c3d2d64fee08dc08.mp3"}],"surfaceRe